+- Run `cargo test -p openlogi-agent-core --test wire_format` before push.
+
+### i18n
+
+New GUI strings: insert the same key in the **same position** in every
+`crates/openlogi-gui/locales/*.yml`. Run `cargo test -p openlogi-gui i18n`.
